Package: runloop
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, systemd (>= 255), ca-certificates
Description: Runloop agent-native operating layer
 Runloop routes prompts to the shell or to sandboxed agents, schedules WASM
 workloads, and maintains the personal ops graph (POG). This package bundles
 the daemon (`runloopd`), CLI (`rlp`), and observability monitor (`agtop`)
 along with systemd units and default configuration for Debian trixie hosts.
